@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@deliveryId = protected-delivery-demo

### Notification deliveries: read remains open
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/deliveries?limit=20

### Retry one delivery: denied without RBAC principal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Retry one delivery: allowed with notification:retry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:retry

{}

### Retry one delivery: allowed with notification:manage fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:manage

{}

### Retry failed: denied without RBAC principal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/retry-failed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 10
}

### Retry failed: allowed with notification:retry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/retry-failed
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:retry

{
  "limit": 10
}

### Retry failed: allowed with notification:manage fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/retry-failed
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:manage

{
  "limit": 10
}
